    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The velvet void dreams The Wilds in silver light. The buzz of 10 inhabitants gracing the air. Sol Mindclear the explorer snags my eye. The rain whispers, fine and soothing. The world is green with new blossoms.</description>
